    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like everything i actually believed in was just a lie. all the stuff i thought gave my life structure and purpose... it's just gone. i'm looking at the world now and there's nothing underneath. no foundation. no ground. just this massive, empty void where everything used to be. it's like i'm just floating in nothingness and i don't think i can keep pretending there's a point to any of it anymore.",
